Projects.Description:
THE PROJECT AIMS TO REDUCE TECH-BASED ABUSE OF WOMEN BY PROMOTING POSITIVE, RESPECTFUL BEHAVIOURS, AS WELL AS ACCOUNTABILITY AND LEADERSHIP, AMONG FIRST NATIONS MEN.
THE PROJECT RESOURCES WILL BE CO-DESIGNED WITH FIRST NATIONS MEN, HARNESSING THEIR VOICES AND IDEAS TO PROMOTE POSITIVE BEHAVIOURS, AND AIM TO ADDRESS THE UNDERLYING DRIVERS OF TECH-BASED ABUSE.
THIS PROJECT WAS FUNDED UNDER THE PREVENTING TECH-BASED ABUSE OF WOMEN GRANTS PROGRAM PRIORITY FUNDING STREAM FOR FIRST NATIONS FOCUSED PROJECTS.
